{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">網上流傳一段車Cam片段，元朗街頭發生一宗涉及P牌私家車逆線事件。一輛掛着P牌的私家車由炮仗坊駛出時，懷疑逆線轉入安寧路，隨後於繁忙的路中心上演「N手軚調頭」試圖修正方向。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-20-16h22m42s393.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026JikI9Vy0kp1787214725.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-20-16h22m42s393.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">片段顯示，涉事的藍色私家車貼有「P」字牌，當時該車橫亘於安寧路的行車線中間，方向完全與正常車流相反。面對前方魚貫而至的車輛，該名司機顯得十分慌張，在路中心上演「N手軚調頭」，過程中，對頭車道的私家車及途經的單車被迫停下避讓，現場交通一度陷入停頓。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-20-16h22m39s046.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20261eZnsaKaw61787214740.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-20-16h22m39s046.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">上載影片的網民發文透露現場狀況：「由炮仗坊駛出嚟逆線左轉安寧路！！叫都叫唔停😮‍💨😮‍💨」。影片曝光後隨即引發大批網民熱議，大批網民指責涉事司機駕駛態度及基本技術欠佳，紛紛留言怒轟：「首先唔好講你 p 牌唔 p 牌，你唔熟路就開個地圖睇啦」、「舉報釘佢牌啦！」及「P仔可以排定期再考過」。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T08:52:23.021906+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":355,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}